sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — InPay card payment (UZS, unsigned callback → re-verified)

    participant U as User (miniapp)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PAY as payments.service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant IN_AD as InpayGateway
    participant IN as InPay (inpay.uz)
    participant FUL as fulfillment.service

    Note over U,IN: pending_payment order, currency == UZS, amount ≥ 1000 so'm

    U->>API: POST /payments/intents {order_id, provider: inpay}
    API->>PAY: create_intent(order_id, "inpay")
    PAY->>DB: SELECT order FOR UPDATE (status == pending_payment)
    PAY->>IN_AD: create_intent(db, order, return_url)
    IN_AD->>IN: GET /authorization?merchant_id&merchant_token (if no cached token)
    IN-->>IN_AD: {success, bearer_token}  (cached ~23h)
    IN_AD->>IN: POST /create (Bearer) {merchant_id, token, amount, callback_url}
    IN-->>IN_AD: {success, order_id, pay_url}
    IN_AD-->>PAY: PaymentIntent(external_id=order_id, intent_url=pay_url, status=pending)
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payments(provider=inpay, status=pending, external_id=order_id)
    PAY-->>U: 201 {intent_url}
    U->>IN: open pay_url, pay (Click/Payme/card)

    Note over IN,API: InPay callback is UNSIGNED — we never trust its body

    IN->>API: POST /webhooks/payments/inpay {order_id, status, amount}
    API->>PAY: handle_webhook("inpay", headers, body)
    PAY->>IN_AD: verify_webhook(body) → read order_id only
    IN_AD->>IN: GET /transactions?order_id (Bearer)  [authoritative status]
    IN-->>IN_AD: {status: success}
    IN_AD-->>PAY: WebhookEvent(external_event_id="order_id:success", outcome=succeeded)
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payment_webhooks (dedup on provider+external_event_id)
    PAY->>DB: payment.status=succeeded; order.status=paid (_mark_payment_succeeded)
    PAY->>FUL: start_for_order(order_id)
    PAY-->>IN: 200 {processed}

    Note over IN,PAY: /transactions=pending → outcome=pending (no FSM change); replay → 200 {duplicate}
